    "C5_reconstructed": "Level-l image after adding its detail coefficients: same region as C3, int32",
    "C6_sharpened": "Level-1 image after sharpening, the input of the level-0 upsampling: 126 rows x 101 columns, int32",
    "C7_raster": "Codec raster, 50,000 bytes in codec order (upside down)",
    "C8_portrait": "C7 reversed (upright portrait), 50,000 bytes"
  },
